§ `Export and Import Offences`

§§ `Section 103 -- Importing or exporting knowing it is unauthorized`

-- src:2216 | 103 (1) Every person commits an offence who imports or exports
-- src:2217 | (a) a prohibited firearm, a restricted firearm, a non-restricted firearm, a prohibited weapon, a restricted weapon, a prohibited device, a firearm part or any prohibited ammunition, or
-- src:2218 | (b) any component or part, other than a firearm part, designed exclusively for use in the manufacture of or assembly into an automatic firearm,
-- src:2219 | knowing that the person is not authorized to do so under the Firearms Act or any other Act of Parliament or any regulations made under an Act of Parliament.
@ref s 103(1) (src:2216-2219)
GIVEN `the kind of thing` IS A `s 84(1) kind of thing`
      `it is a component or part, other than a firearm part, designed exclusively for use in the manufacture of or assembly into an automatic firearm` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 84(1) import: the act is an import` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 84(1) export: the act is an export` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the person knows that the person is not authorized to do so under the Firearms Act or any other Act of Parliament or any regulations made under any Act of Parliament` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 103(1) the person commits an offence of importing or exporting knowing it is unauthorized` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the elements` EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `the elements` EQUALS NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (undefined term): the answer of s 84(1) import or s 84(1) export is not covered
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Every person commits an offence who imports or exports" (an unmet element)
    WHERE
        -- (a) a prohibited firearm, a restricted firearm, a non-restricted firearm, a prohibited weapon, a restricted weapon, a prohibited device, a firearm part or any prohibited ammunition, or (b) any component or part, other than a firearm part, designed exclusively for use in the manufacture of or assembly into an automatic firearm
        `the thing is one that the paragraphs name` MEANS
               `s 84(1) the kind of thing is a firearm` `the kind of thing`
               OR `the kind of thing` EQUALS `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited weapon`
               OR `the kind of thing` EQUALS `s 84(1) kind: a restricted weapon`
               OR `s 84(1) the kind of thing is a prohibited device` `the kind of thing`
               OR `the kind of thing` EQUALS `s 84(1) kind: a firearm part`
               OR `the kind of thing` EQUALS `s 84(1) kind: prohibited ammunition`
               OR `it is a component or part, other than a firearm part, designed exclusively for use in the manufacture of or assembly into an automatic firearm`
        `the act` MEANS `s 84(1) some limb holds` (LIST `s 84(1) import: the act is an import`, `s 84(1) export: the act is an export`)
        `the elements` MEANS `s 84(1) every condition of the limb holds` (LIST (JUST `the thing is one that the paragraphs name`), `the act`, (JUST `the person knows that the person is not authorized to do so under the Firearms Act or any other Act of Parliament or any regulations made under any Act of Parliament`))

-- src:2220 | Punishment — firearm
-- src:2221 | (2) Every person who commits an offence under subsection (1) when the object in question is a prohibited firearm, a restricted firearm, a non-restricted firearm, a prohibited device, a firearm part or any prohibited ammunition is guilty of an indictable offence and liable to imprisonment for a term not exceeding 14 years and to a minimum punishment of imprisonment for a term of
-- src:2222 | (a) in the case of a first offence, three years; and
-- src:2223 | (b) in the case of a second or subsequent offence, five years.
@ref s 103(2) (src:2220-2223)
GIVETH A `Class of offence`
`s 103(2) the class of the offence` MEANS `an indictable offence`

@ref s 103(2) (src:2220-2223)
GIVEN `the kind of thing the object in question is` IS A `s 84(1) kind of thing`
      `it is a second or subsequent offence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE Punishment
`s 103(2) the punishment when the object in question is a firearm, device, part or prohibited ammunition` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`the object is one the subsection names`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "when the object in question is" (subsection (2.1) governs any other case)
        IF `it is a second or subsequent offence` THEN JUST (Punishment WITH `mode` IS `by indictment`, `maximum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), `minimum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `five years`), `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`, `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`)   -- (b) in the case of a second or subsequent offence, five years
        OTHERWISE JUST (Punishment WITH `mode` IS `by indictment`, `maximum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), `minimum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `s 99(2) three years`), `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`, `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`)   -- (a) in the case of a first offence, three years
    WHERE
        -- a prohibited firearm, a restricted firearm, a non-restricted firearm, a prohibited device, a firearm part or any prohibited ammunition
        `the object is one the subsection names` MEANS
               `s 84(1) the kind of thing is a firearm` `the kind of thing the object in question is`
               OR `s 84(1) the kind of thing is a prohibited device` `the kind of thing the object in question is`
               OR `the kind of thing the object in question is` EQUALS `s 84(1) kind: a firearm part`
               OR `the kind of thing the object in question is` EQUALS `s 84(1) kind: prohibited ammunition`

-- src:2224 | Punishment — other cases
-- src:2225 | (2.1) In any other case, a person who commits an offence under subsection (1) is guilty of an indictable offence and liable to imprisonment for a term of not more than 14 years.
@ref s 103(2.1) (src:2224-2225)
GIVETH A `Class of offence`
`s 103(2.1) the class of the offence` MEANS `an indictable offence`

@ref s 103(2.1) (src:2224-2225)
GIVEN `the kind of thing the object in question is` IS A `s 84(1) kind of thing`
GIVETH A MAYBE Punishment
`s 103(2.1) the punishment in any other case` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`the case is one subsection (2) governs`) THEN JUST (Punishment WITH `mode` IS `by indictment`, `maximum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), `minimum imprisonment` IS `no imprisonment is stated`, `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`, `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`)
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "In any other case" (subsection (2) governs when the object is a firearm, device, part or prohibited ammunition)
    WHERE
        `the case is one subsection (2) governs` MEANS
               `s 84(1) the kind of thing is a firearm` `the kind of thing the object in question is`
               OR `s 84(1) the kind of thing is a prohibited device` `the kind of thing the object in question is`
               OR `the kind of thing the object in question is` EQUALS `s 84(1) kind: a firearm part`
               OR `the kind of thing the object in question is` EQUALS `s 84(1) kind: prohibited ammunition`

