§§ `Section 105 -- Losing or finding`

-- src:2247 | Losing or finding
-- src:2248 | 105 (1) Every person commits an offence who
-- src:2249 | (a) having lost a prohibited firearm, a restricted firearm, a non-restricted firearm, a prohibited weapon, a restricted weapon, a prohibited device, any prohibited ammunition, an authorization, a licence or a registration certificate, or having had it stolen from the person’s possession, does not with reasonable despatch report the loss to a peace officer, to a firearms officer or a chief firearms officer; or
@ref s 105(1)(a) (src:2247-2249)
GIVEN `the kind of thing` IS A `s 84(1) kind of thing`
      `it is an authorization, a licence or a registration certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person has lost it, or has had it stolen from the person’s possession` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person does not with reasonable despatch report the loss to a peace officer, to a firearms officer or a chief firearms officer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 105(1)(a) the person commits an offence by not reporting a loss` MEANS
    IF     (`the thing is one that the paragraph names`)
       AND `the person has lost it, or has had it stolen from the person’s possession`
       AND `the person does not with reasonable despatch report the loss to a peace officer, to a firearms officer or a chief firearms officer`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Every person commits an offence who" (an unmet element: "having lost ... does not with reasonable despatch report the loss")
    WHERE
        -- a prohibited firearm, a restricted firearm, a non-restricted firearm, a prohibited weapon, a restricted weapon, a prohibited device, any prohibited ammunition, an authorization, a licence or a registration certificate
        `the thing is one that the paragraph names` MEANS
               `s 84(1) the kind of thing is a firearm` `the kind of thing`
               OR `the kind of thing` EQUALS `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited weapon`
               OR `the kind of thing` EQUALS `s 84(1) kind: a restricted weapon`
               OR `s 84(1) the kind of thing is a prohibited device` `the kind of thing`
               OR `the kind of thing` EQUALS `s 84(1) kind: prohibited ammunition`
               OR `it is an authorization, a licence or a registration certificate`

